# KiCad per-user local state and backups (regenerated by the CLI; not source).
*.kicad_prl
*-backups/
*.kicad_sch-bak
fp-info-cache
_autosave-*
# Transient ERC / netlist reports (regenerate via scripts/erc.sh).
*-erc.rpt
*.net
*.xml
# Routing + manufacturing intermediates (regenerate via scripts/route_*.py +
# scripts/export_fab.sh). The routed board (.kicad_pcb) + project (.kicad_pro)
# ARE source; the DSN/SES exchange files, DRC reports, and the fab package output
# are not.
*.dsn
*.ses
*-drc.json
manufacturing/
# The PDF render is regenerable via scripts/render.sh; keep the SVG as the
# committed viewable snapshot (renders in a git web viewer, diffs as text).
*.pdf
